# EnemyAtk_HitScriptSpark: no corpus run calls it (ruling 5, 2). Its one caller is the claw fight's
# falling debris (a4 script $01ECF2: Op4_BranchTouchPlayer, then Op4_CallNative dc.l $010726 with
# dc.w $20, dc.l Scr4_010964 at $01ED10). The cases run at EnemyAtk_HitTouch's first call, the same
# shape of call (an a4 object's Op4_BranchTouchPlayer then Op4_CallNative, $1ABA2-$1ABAC: a2 = the
# player's struck box, a6 = the attacker, d4-d7 = the touch rectangle), with a4 at the debris
# script's operands.

at $0106A8

case hit
reg a4 = $01ED10
b a2 + $3C = 0
b {{a2 + $2E} + $C} + $16 = 0

case already_struck
reg a4 = $01ED10
b a2 + $3C = 1

case invulnerable
reg a4 = $01ED10
b a2 + $3C = 0
b {{a2 + $2E} + $C} + $16 = $78
